# Agent map — <%= it.projectName %>

> Installed and maintained by [Reins](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fermin-dev/reins) (`<%= it.preset %>` preset, harness v<%= it.harnessVersion %>). This file is a **map**, not a rulebook — read what you need, when you need it.

## The model

This repository is the system. Documentation, configuration, living state, and traces all persist as versioned files. Multiple specialized agents collaborate with **disjoint powers** and write their results to disk, never relying on chat memory.

## Roles (`.claude/agents/`)

| Agent | Powers | Model | Responsibility |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `leader` | Read, Grep, Bash, Agent | <%= it.agents.leader.model ?? "inherit" %> | Orchestrates; never edits code. |
| `implementer` | Read, Write, Edit, Bash | <%= it.agents.implementer.model ?? "inherit" %> | Implements one feature + its tests; self-verifies. |
| `reviewer` | Read, Grep, Bash | <%= it.agents.reviewer.model ?? "inherit" %> | Approves/rejects against docs + checkpoints + the Four R's (`docs/four-rs.md`). |
| `security-reviewer` | Read, Grep, Bash | <%= it.agents["security-reviewer"].model ?? "inherit" %> | Audits secrets, input handling, dependencies. |
| `design-reviewer` | Read, Grep, Bash | <%= it.agents["design-reviewer"].model ?? "inherit" %> | Audits UI for "AI slop", design-system fidelity, a11y, motion (`docs/design.md`, `docs/motion.md`). |
<% if (it.isSdd) { %>| `spec_author` | Write to `specs/` only | <%= it.agents.spec_author.model ?? "inherit" %> | Writes EARS requirements, design, tasks. |
<% } %>
Per-role model and effort are set in `reins.config.json` under `agents` (`inherit` = use the session's model/effort).

## Workflow

<%~ include("partials/workflow-lanes.md.eta", it) %>

**All artifacts are written in English.** Chat can happen in any language; files written to disk (`specs/`, `progress/`, docs) are always English.

## Verification is law

`<%= it.verifyCmd %>` runs the project's gate (lint, tests, e2e, security) cross-platform and returns non-zero when a required check fails. It is wired into Claude Code hooks (`.claude/settings.json`): each edit lints the changed file, the implementer runs the related tests, and the session is blocked from ending on a red tree. A pass on an unchanged tree is reused from cache, so repeated runs are cheap. Run `reins doctor` to check the harness itself.

## Session close checklist

1. `<%= it.verifyCmd %>` is green.
2. Finished feature is marked `done` in `feature_list.json`.
3. Session summary moved from `progress/current.md` into `progress/history.md` (append-only).
4. No stray `.tmp` files, debug prints, or unexplained TODOs left behind.
